  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Noffica",
      "content": "A lawyer who proves to be inherently more devious than all the gangsters, whilst at the same time, being no more likeable than them.\r\n\r\nIt was unfortunate that every other character was almost stupid. It was also strange after the second episode that the lead character, whilst he did try to establish an equilibrium, did not try to distance himself from the gangsters. There was always this un-addressed undercurrent that he wanted to remain quite involved with these gangsters.",
      "rating": 5,
      "createdAt": "2024-11-22T20:12:59Z"
    },
    {
      "author": "Dean",
      "content": "Pretty good show and definitely better than any other German shows I have seen so far. Kinda reminds me \"Lilyhammer\" which was an amazing show.",
      "rating": 8,
      "createdAt": "2025-10-24T10:54:43Z"
    }
  ],
